// The game's kinds of block with a class of their own — `kind: "stairs"`
// on a `.yblock` — as `BlockKind`s: the texture slots its models take, the
// game's template models it's drawn with (`""` the block's own model,
// `<block>_<name>` the others, `base` the model of its `block.base`), which
// state shows which (as the game's own blockstates), what its item shows and
// how it drops. The hosts make each kind of the game's class by name.
